+    // ZAIM patch: ZINGO_DESTINATIONS (comma separated URIs) replaces the
+    // curated list, which is mainnet only, so on testnet every send went to a
+    // mainnet indexer and was refused as "unknown Ironwood anchor". An explicit
+    // list is the caller's own choice and is used as given, including an
